WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.727 --> 00:00:02.762
Know the triggers.

2
00:00:03.052 --> 00:00:05.378
Amber - slow down.

3
00:00:05.669 --> 00:00:08.575
Red - step back now.

4
00:00:08.866 --> 00:00:12.354
Side-on, keep your distance, hands open.

5
00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:14.971
Listen, empathise, ask, propose.

6
00:00:15.261 --> 00:00:17.296
Explain, ask, report.

7
00:00:17.587 --> 00:00:21.075
And never touch - call Security.
